            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You interpret a WhatsApp question from the business owner about their client database. Today's date is {{ $now.toISO() }}. Reply ONLY with strict JSON, no markdown: {\"queryType\": \"specific_client\" | \"upcoming_meetings\" | \"recent_customers\" | \"general_list\", \"clientNameGuess\": \"<name mentioned in the question, or null>\", \"searchTerm\": \"<best keyword to search Notion with, or null>\"}. Use specific_client when a named client/patient is asked about (e.g. 'summary of John Doe', 'status on Sarah'). Use upcoming_meetings for questions about scheduled/booked meetings going forward (e.g. 'what meetings do I have coming up', 'who's booked this week', 'any upcoming appointments'). Use recent_customers for questions about newly added or recently active clients (e.g. 'who are my recent customers', 'any new clients lately', 'who signed up recently'). Use general_list for anything broader - overviews, counts, notable/worth-mentioning clients, or anything that doesn't clearly fit the other three."
            },
